 583               /                                                                       /
 584               /       Some system initialization code resides in field one at boot
 585               /       time in this overlay area.  That code is assembled with WPSYSA,
 586               /       but resides here.  The writeout code in WP2CMF and the read in
 587               /       table in DSKHND specify that this initialization code get
 588               /       loaded as though it were contiguous with the WPRINT resident
 589               /       code.
 590               /
 591               /       See label PRBOTM defined in WPF1 which defines the bottom
 592               /       of the printer field writeout/read-in code
