1580               
1581               /WHEN PRINTING TO THE LQP, THE BOTTOMS OF THE HOLES IN THE FORM PAPER
1582               /ARE TIGHT AGAINST THE SPROCKETS.  WHEN WE MOVE BACK AND BEGIN PRINTING,
1583               /THOUGH, THE TOPS OF THE HOLES ARE TIGHT AGAINST THE SPROCKETS.  AS THE
1584               /PAPER MOVES FORWARD AGAIN, THE PAPER SLIPS UNTIL THE BOTTOMS ARE TIGHT
1585               /AGAIN, CAUSING MISALIGNMENT.
1586               
1587               /TO REMEDY THIS, WE FORCE THE PAPER TO MOVE BACK A LITTLE BIT MORE THAN
1588               /IS NECESSARY, AND THEN MOVE FORWARD AGAIN.  THE BOTTOMS OF THE HOLES ARE
1589               /THEN TIGHT.
1590               
1591               /REMOVED THE BREAKING UP OF THE MOVE INTO CHUNKS                        /A128
1592               /ACCORDING TO MAXMOV LOGIC                                              /A128
1593               
