1634               /TAKE PLACE.
1635               
1636               /THE VALUE PRTMOV CONTAINS THE TOTAL MOTION WHICH HAS BEEN TRANSMITTED
1637               /BUT NOT FORCED TO DATE.  IT IS CLEARED BY THIS ROUTINE (WHICH FORCES
1638               /THE MOTION).
