1641               /VARIABLES, BECAUSE THIS ROUTINE IS PROVIDED ONLY FOR CALL BY PRMOVE,
1642               /WHICH HAS PREVIOUSLY RECORDED THE MOVEMENT.  ALL OTHER CALLERS SHOULD
1643               /USE PRMOVE TO MAKE THE MOTION AND RECORD THE MOVE, AND ONLY THEN CALL
1644               /PRFMOV WITH A ZERO ARGUMENT TO FORCE THE MOTION.
