1881                                               / YOU ASTUTE READERS CARED
1882                       TAD     PRQCM
1883                       SZA CLA
1884                       JMP     PRCHR4          / NO, PROCEED NORMALLY
1885               
1886                       TAD     PRCHAT          / GET THE CHARACTER TO BE PRINTED
1887                       TAD     (-33)           / SEE IF ESCAPE
1888                       SNA
1889                       JMP     PRCESC          / YES, GO PRINT AN ASCII E
1890               
1891                       TAD     (33-15)         / SEE IF CARRIAGE RETURN
1892                       SZA CLA
1893                       JMP     PRCHR4          / NO, PROCEED AS USUAL
