1973               /       STORED WITHOUT THE 'ESC [' AS THESE ARE PRESENT IN ALL ESCAPE
1974               /       STRINGS.  THE OUTPUT ROUTINE 'CSISTR' AUTOMATICALLY OUTPUTS
1975               /       THOSE TWO COMPONENTS.
