2143 003207  0774          AND     PRQSP           / ISOLATE BIT 11
2144 003210  3253          DCA     ESCT2           / ESCT2 = SHADOW BIT (AC11)
2145               /
2146 003211  1253          TAD     ESCT2
2147 003212  0775          AND     ESCT1           / SHADOW (AND) BOLD => ACC 11
2148 003213  7010          RAR                     / INTO LINK
2149 003214  7200          CLA
2150 003215  1373          TAD     (XDSHAD         / SEND SHADOW IF BOLD AND SHADOW
2151 003216  4237          JMS     XDSTR
2152 003217  7420          SNL                     / BOLD BIT IS IN LINK
2153 003220  5224          JMP     ESCDRK          / ACC IS CLEAR
2154 003221  1253          TAD     ESCT2           / BOLD, SO IF NOT SHADOW
2155 003222  7040          CMA
