2829               /                                                                       /A021
2830               /       THIS ROUTINE ACCEPTS ATTRIBUTED ASCII CHARS FROM THE EDITOR AND /A021
2831               /       PROCESSESES THEM ACCORDING TO THE SPECIFICATIONS GIVEN IN       /A021
2832               /       "VT278 - THE PHASE II PLAN"                                     /A021
2833               /       -- SECTION 8.4.16 --                                            /A021
