6861 031040* 7100          CLL
6862               
6863               /At this point, we rejoin the code for the non-wheel case.  The possibilities
6864               /are as follows:
6865               
6866               /1.  Not two wheel, not bold:  AC=0, LINK=0
6867               /2.  Not two-wheel, bold:      AC=0, LINK=1
6868               /3.  Two-wheel, printing       AC=0, LINK=0
6869               /4.  Two-wheel, not printing:  AC=-1,LINK=0
6870               
6871               /So, after performing an RAL, we have the following corresponding cases:
6872               
6873               /1.  Not two-wheel, not bold:  AC=0
6874               /2.  Not two-wheel, bold:      AC=1
6875               /3.  Two-wheel, printing:      AC=0
6876               /4.  Two-wheel, not printing:  AC=-2
6877               
6878               /Upon adding the darkness, we will have the proper hit count for each case.
