9130               /                                                                       /
9131               /       TCKBTB--TECHNICAL CHARACTER TO KEYBOARD CONVERSION TABLE        /
9132               /               USED TO CONVERT TECHNICAL CHARACTERS BACK TO THE        /
9133               /               ASCII KEY CODE WHICH WAS TYPED WHEN THEY WERE INSERTED  /
9134               /               INTO THE WPS DOCUMENT.  USED WHEN DD=CHST, REAL HOST    /
9135               /               APPLICATION.                                            /
9136               /                                                                       /
9137               /               NOTE THAT THERE ARE 94 ENTRIES IN THIS TABLE IN         /
9138               /               THE RANGE FROM 41-176 OCTAL                             /
9139               /                                                                       /
9140               /               THE LOGIC LOOKS AT THE PRECEDENCE CODE.                 /
9141               /               IF IT IS 21, SUBTRACT 57 AND OUTPUT THE NEXT CHARACTER. /
9142               /               IF IT IS 22 OR 23 IT READS THIS TABLE./
9143               /               IF THE ENTRY FOUND IS AN ASCII CHR IT JUST OUTPUTS      /
9144               /               THAT CHR.                                               /
9145               /               IF THE ENTRY FOUND IS GREATER THAN 377 IT IS A POINTER  /MRCM
9146               /               TO A TWO WORD TABLE.  THE FIRST WORD IS THE CHARACTER   /
9147               /               TO OUTPUT IF THE PRECENCE CODE WAS 22, THE SECOND WORD  /
9148               /               IS THE CHARACTER TO OUTPUT IF THE PRECENCE CODE WAS 23. /
9149               /                                                                       /
9150               /***********************************************************************/
