undefined       	   	   ^
     031216* 0000  
9989 031217* 1372          TAD     (-23)
9990 031220* 7450          SNA             /IS IT 23?
9991 031221* 5771          JMP     DPLI4H  /YES
9992 031222* 7001          IAC
9993 031223* 7450          SNA             /IS IT 22?
9994 031224* 5770          JMP     DPLI4C  /IS 22 PROCESS AND DON'T CONTRIBUTE TO JUSTIFICATION
9995 031225* 7001          IAC
9996 031226* 7650          SNA CLA         /IS IT 21?
9997 031227* 5767          JMP     DPLI4E  /YES
9998               
9999 031230* 1436          TAD I   PLPTR   /NOT A CONTROL CHARACTER, GET IT BACK AND CONTINUE
10000               
10001               /PAPER MOVEMENT CHECK AREA.
10002               /NOW CHECK TO SEE IF SUPERSCRIPT OR SUBSCRIPT IS REQUIRED. THIS WILL    /A222
10003               /MOVING THE PAPER UP OR DOWN AS REQUIRED PRIOR TO PRINTING THE CHARACTER/A222
10004               
10005 031231* 0366          AND     (0400)  /MASK OUT ALL BUT THE SUPER/SUB BIT.            /A222
10006 031232* 7650          SNA CLA         /?                                              /A222
10007 031233* 5241          JMP     DPLI4A  /NO SUPER OR SUB BIT, JUST PRINT THE CHARACTER  /A222
10008 031234* 1436          TAD I   PLPTR   /GET CHARACTER BACK
10009 031235* 0365          AND     (0200)  /TEST FOR SUPERSCRIPT                           /A222
10010 031236* 7650          SNA CLA                                                         /A222
10011 031237* 5764          JMP     LPSUPR  /POSITION TO SUPERSCRIPT AND RETURN TO DPLIN5   /A222
10012 031240* 5763          JMP     LPSUB   /POSITION TO SUBSCRIPT AND RETURN TO DPLIN5     /A222
10013               
10014               /NO SUPER OR SUB IN CHARACTER ATTRIBUTES
10015               
10016 031241* 1762  DPLI4A, TAD     CURPOS  /ARE WE POSITIONED CORRECTLY?
10017 031242* 7450          SNA
10018 031243* 5251          JMP     DPLIN5  /YES
10019               
10020 031244* 7510          SPA             /NO, DO WE HAVE TO GO UP OR DOWN?
10021 031245* 5250          JMP     DPLI4B  /IS NEGATIVE, GO UP
10022               
10023 031246* 4761          JMS     MOVEDN  /IS UP, GO DOWN
10024 031247* 5251          JMP     DPLIN5  /DONE
10025               
10026 031250* 4760  DPLI4B, JMS     MOVEUP  /WE ARE DOWN, MOVE UP.
10027               
10028               /CHECK TO SEE IF UNDERSCORE
10029               
10030 031251* 7200  DPLIN5, CLA
10031 031252* 4757          JMS     CFUNDL  /CHECK FOR UNDERLINE ATTRIBUTES
10032 031253* 5756          JMP     PUNDL   /RETURN 1: YES, GO TO PUNDL AND RETURN TO DPLI5D
10033 031254* 1436  DPLI5A, TAD I   PLPTR   /RETURN 2: NO UNDL, GET CHARACTER
10034 031255* 0355          AND     (2000)  /SEE IF BOLD BIT SET.
10035 031256* 3754          DCA     PRBIC   /SET FLAG IN LPBI ROUTINE.
10036 031257* 1067          TAD     PRBIF   /CHECK TO SEE IF ANOTHER MEANING FOR BOLD BIT.
10037 031260* 7640          SZA CLA
10038 031261* 4753          JMS     LPBI    /YES, CHANGE FONT OR CHARACTER SETS.
10039 031262* 1436  DPLI5B, TAD I   PLPTR   /GET THE CHR BACK
10040               
10041               /WE TEST TO SEE IF THE CODE IS THAT OF THE REQUIRED SPACE RQSP          /A216
10042               /IF SO, WE PRINT THE SPACE CODE (40) INSTEAD OF THE REQUIRED SPACE (177)/A216
10043               /CODE. THIS IS BECAUSE THE REQUIRED SPACE CODE IS JUST A PHONY CODE TO  /A216
10044               /BE REPLACED AT THIS TIME SO THAT IT CANNOT CONTRIBUTE TO JUSTIFICATION /A216
10045               
10046                       AND     P177    /BIT 0 MAY OR MAY NOT BE SET
undefined       	   	   ^
undefined       	   	   ^
     031263* 0000  
10047 031264* 1352          TAD     (-RQSP) /SUBTRACT REQUIRED SPACE CODE (177)             /A216
10048 031265* 7640          SZA CLA         /SKIP IF REQUIRED SPACE                         /A216
10049 031266* 5271          JMP     DPLI5C  /NOT A REQUIRED SPACE
10050 031267* 1351          TAD     (SPC)   /IT IS A REQUIRED SPACE.
10051 031270* 5273          JMP     DPLI5E  /PRINT AN ASCII 40 (SPACE).
10052               
10053 031271* 4750  DPLI5C, JMS     PRSO    /SEE IF PRINT SHIFT OUT (SO)
10054               
10055 031272* 7501  DPLI5D, MQA
10056 031273* 4747  DPLI5E, JMS     PRCHAR  /PRINT IT AFTER ALL THE FINAGLEING.
10057 031274* 7200          CLA
10058 031275* 4746          JMS     PRSI    /DO WE PRINT SHIFT IN (SI)?
