10060               
10061               /NOW WE SEE IF ANY JUSTIFICATION IS NECESSARY.  ALL SPACES IN THE
10062               /JUSTIFIABLE PORTION OF THE LINE ARE MARKED WITH BIT 0 SET.  AN EXTRA
10063               /PLSS UNITS ARE ADDED TO EACH SUCH SPACE.  IN ADDITION, PLSSC IS
10064               /INCREMENTED EACH TIME.  AS LONG AS IT REMAINS NEGATIVE OR ZERO, AN
10065               /EXTRA UNIT IS ADDED TO EACH SPACE.  SINCE ONLY UNITS IN MULTIPLES OF
10066               /SPACES ARE OUTPUT IN LPMOVE, LEFTOVER UNITS ARE RETAINED UNTIL THE
10067               /NEXT SPACE.
10068                       
10069               /FIRST DETERMINE IF THE CHARACTER JUST OUTPUT WAS A JUSTIFIABLE SPACE.
10070               
10071 031276* 1436          TAD I   PLPTR   /GET THE CHARACTER
10072 031277* 7700          SMA CLA         /WAS IT A JUSTIFIABLE CHARACTER--CONSIDER AC0
10073 031300* 5745          JMP     DPLIN8  /IT WASN'T--NO JUSTIFICATION
10074               
10075               /Next determine how much space to add.  We increment PLSSC each time.  As soon
10076               /as it reaches zero, we now longer use one additional unit.
10077               
10078 031301* 2744          ISZ     PLSSC   /Increment the remainder counter
10079 031302* 7000          NOP             /In case it skips
10080               
10081 031303* 1744          TAD     PLSSC   /See if the remainder counter is still negative
10082 031304* 7710          SPA CLA
10083                       AC0001          /Yes--use one additional unit
undefined       	     ^
     031305* 0000  
10084               
10085 031306* 1000          TAD     PLSS    /Recover the extra space sizing
10086               
10087               /WE NOW HAVE THE AMOUNT OF EXTRA SPACING REQUIRED IN THE AC.  LPMOVE PADS
10088               /OUT AS MUCH OF THE EXTRA SPACE AS IT CAN BY PRINTING THE CHARACTER IN THE
10089               /MQ.
10090               
10091 031307* 4743          JMS     LPMOVE  /DO THE MOTION
10092               
10093 031310* 5745          JMP     DPLIN8
