10101               /ALSO THE BOLD INTERPRETATION FLAG IS CHECKED IF THE HIT BITS ARE NOT 0.
10102               /THIS IS THE FLAG THAT CHANGES THE MEANING OF THE BOLD BIT. IF PRBIF SET, THEN
10103               /INTERPRET THE BOLD BIT AS CHANGE FONT OR CHARACTER SET FOR THAT CHARACTER ONLY.
10104               /THIS IS SO YOU CAN PRINT WITH AN ACCENT OR UMLAUT OVER THE CHARACTER FROM
10105               /ANOTHER FONT. DARK BIT STILL MEANS THE SAME.
