11072               /THIS ROUTINE RESTORES THE STATE OF THE PRINTER AND FILE SYSTEM.  IT IS USED
11073               /TO "RECOVER" SAVED HEADERS AND FOOTERS SO THAT THEY CAN BE PRINTED AND
11074               /TO "RECOVER" OUR PLACE AFTER WE PRINT HEADERS/FOOTERS SO THAT WE CAN
11075               /PICK UP WHERE WE LEFT OFF.
11076               
11077               /THE ARGUMENT TO THIS ROUTINE IS ZERO IF REGULAR TEXT IS TO BE RESTORED; MINUS
