11458               / RELOADS THE PRINTER FIELD BY READING ONLY THE RESIDENT BLOCKS         
11459               / BACK IN FROM THE DISK.  WHEN THE OTHER JOB DOES THE JSTRT             
11460               / WE WILL START IN RESIDENT CODE AND EVERYTHING WILL BE COOL            
