11905               /THIS SECTION IS INVOKED WHEN A NON-DIGIT CHARACTER IS READ.  IF WE ARE AT
11906               /THE END OF THE CONTROL BLOCK, THE ZERO IS RETURNED.  OTHERWISE,
11907               /THE VALUE IN PRMCFF IS TESTED.  IF IT IS STILL NEGATIVE, NO DIGITS HAVE BEEN
11908               /FOUND YET, AND WE KEEP LOOKING.  IF IT IS NOW NON-NEGATIVE, WE HAVE FOUND
11909               /A NUMBER AND THIS CHARACTER TERMINATES IT.  RETURN THE NUMBER.
11910               
11911               /THIS SECTION IS INVOKED WHEN A NON-DIGIT CHARACTER IS READ.  THE VALUE OF
11912               /PRMCFF IS TESTED.  IF IT IS STILL NEGATIVE, NO DIGITS HAVE BEEN FOUND
11913               /YET, AND WE KEEP LOOKING.  IF IT IS NOW NON-NEGATIVE, WE HAVE FOUND A
11914               /NUMBER AND THIS CHARACTER TERMINATES IT.  RETURN THE NUMBER.
11915               
11916               PRMCG2,
11917 030732* 7200          CLA
11918               
11919 030733* 1342          TAD     PRMCFF  /SEE IF A NUMBER WAS FOUND
11920 030734* 7710          SPA CLA
11921 030735* 5316          JMP     PRMCG1  /NO--KEEP LOOKING
11922               
11923 030736* 1341          TAD     PRMCGT  /YES--RETURN THE NUMBER
11924 030737* 2312          ISZ     PRMCGN
11925 030740* 5712          JMP I   PRMCGN
11926               
11927 030741* 0000  PRMCGT, 0       /THE DIGITS ARE COMBINED INTO A NUMBER HERE
11928 030742* 0000  PRMCFF, 0       /THIS FLAG IS NEGATIVE UNTIL A DIGIT IS FOUND, IS POSITIVE
11929                               /THERAFTER.  ALSO SERVES AS A TEMPORARY.
