12710               /PRCLUP "CLEANS UP" ANY EXTRA JUSTIFICATION NEEDED TO BE DONE. THIS COULD
12711               /OCCUR IF WE HAVE JUST PROCESSED A HEADER OR FOOTER AND HAVE ADDED MORE
12712               /OR LESS THAN 2 CHARACTERS FOR BACKSLASH PROCESSING, AS IN THE INSERTION
12713               /OF THE DATE FOR \D. IF THIS IS NECESSARY, THE APPROPRIATE NUMBER OF SOFT
12714               /SPACES ARE DELETED OR ADDED UNTIL THE LINE IS AGAIN PROPERLY JUSTIFIED.
