13050               
13051               / "PRINTER GRAPHIC" CONTROL SEEN
13052               / ENTER SIXEL GRAPHICS MODE.  SEND THE ESCAPE SEQUENCE TO ENTER THE MODE
13053               / AND THEN ENTER THE TEXT MODE.  THIS MERELY SENDS THE TEXTUAL CHARACTERS
13054               / SEEN IN THE REST OF THE CONTROL, WHICH ARE INTERPRETED AS SIXELS.  THE
13055               / SIXEL TEXT MUST BE WITHINT THE CONTROL SO THAT NORMAL LINE COUNTING
13056               / IS DISABLED.  IN THIS MODE WE COUNT GRAPHIC NEW LINE CODES (HYPHENS),
13057               / KEEP TRACK OF HOW FAR DOWN THE PAGE THE GRAPHIC TAKES US.  WE DO NOT
13058               / ATTEMPT TO DETERMINE IF WE GO BEYOND A PAGE BOUNDARY.  IN ORDER TO EXIT
13059               / GRAPHICS MODE WE HAVE AN END CONTROL, A START CONTROL WITH
13060               
13061               / "PRINTER RETURN", FOLLOWED BY END CONTROL
13062 041130* 3000          DCA     GRALNC          / CLEAR COUNT OF GRAPHIC NEW LINES
13063 041131* 1043          TAD     PRMCLM          / INDENT THE GRAPHIC
13064 041132* 4765          JMS     LPIND           /
13065 041133* 4764          JMS     PRESCS          / PUT OUT ESCAPE SEQUENCE
13066 041134* 4114                  PCGR            / TO ENTER SIXEL GRAPHICS MODE
13067 041135* 5200          JMP     PCTXTL          / AND ENTER TEXT MODE
13068               
13069               OVGRET=.-OVRLCA
13070               
13071               / "PRINTER RETURN" SEEN.  EXIT THE GRAPHICS MODE, AND RETURN TO THE VERTICAL
13072               / POSITION ON THE PAGE WHERE GRAPHICS MODE WAS ENTERED.
13073               
13074 041136* 4764          JMS     PRESCS          / SEND SEQUENCE
13075 041137* 4115                  PCGREX          / TO EXIT GRAPHICS MODE
13076                                               / *** NOTE THIS SEQUENCE CONTAINS A CARRIAGE
13077                                               / RETURN WHICH IS NECESSARY TO RESET THE
13078                                               / INDENT BECAUSE LPIND DOES IT AGAIN WITH
13079                                               / SPACES FOR THE LA50...
13080 041140* 1000          TAD     GRALNC          / GET NUMBER OF GRAPHIC LINES
13081 041141* 7104          CLL RAL                 / MULTIPLY
13082 041142* 7104          CLL RAL                 / BY FOUR
13083 041143* 7041          CIA                     / NEGATE
13084 041144* 4764          JMS     PRESCS          / CALL PRESCS TO OUTPUT MOVE
13085 041145* 0071                  PCMPUP          /
13086 041146* 7200                  CLA             /
13087 041147* 3000          DCA     GRALNC          / CLEAR LINE COUNT
13088 041150* 4223          JMS     PRSTRP          / STRIP REST OF CONTROL
13089 041151* 1363          TAD     (OVSTRP         / GO STRIP REST OF CONTROL
13090 041152* 4762          JMS     PROV
13091 041153* 0415                  OBSTRP
