13332               /LIST PROCESSING READ LOOP--
13333               /THIS WAIT LOOP CONTINUALLY TESTS PRIRFD.  AS LONG AS THE VALUE IS POSITIVE,
13334               /THE WAIT LOOP CONTINUES.  WHEN THE VALUE GOES ZERO, PRINTING IS ENDED AND
13335               /A NEW DOCUMENT IS RECOVERED.  IF THE VALUE IS NEGATIVE, ANOTHER COPY IS
13336               /READY.  THIS NEGATIVE VALUE DOUBLES AS A CIF INSTRUCTION WHICH IS USED TO
13337               /PATCH RDEDIT.
