13562 040614* 7500          SMA             /SKIP IF THE RESULT IS NEGATIVE
13563 040615* 4776          JMS     PRMOVE  /MOVE THE AMOUNT THE HEADER WON'T USE
13564 040616* 7200          CLA
13565               
13566 040617* 1777          TAD     PRQTMG  /USE THE TOP MARGIN SIZE
