14593               /     THE NUMBER OF COPIES, IT IS NEGATED AND STORED IN PRQCPY.  PRQ2W
14594               /     IS MADE POSITIVE TO INDICATE SECOND PASS.
14595               
14596               /IF PRQ2W>0, WE ARE THROUGH WITH THE SECOND PASS.  PRQ2W IS CLEARED, AND
14597               /     WE CONTINUE BY RETURNING TO THE DONE OVERLAY                      /C140
