15033               
15034               /EVEN IF PRINTING IS CURRENTLY INHIBITED, WE WANT THE MOTION TO OCCUR.  SAVE
15035               /THE PRINT INHIBIT FLAG SO THAT IT CAN BE RESTORED AT THE END OF THE ROUTINE,
15036               /AND THEN CLEAR THE FLAG TO PERMIT THE MOTION.
15037               
15038 041321* 1034          TAD     PRYES   /GET PRINT INHIBIT FLAG
15039 041322* 3355          DCA     PRSTTB  /SAVE IT
15040 041323* 3034          DCA     PRYES   /CLEAR PRINT INHIBIT FLAG
15041               
15042               /IF PRINTING IS INHIBITED, THE POSITION IN WHICH THE PRINTER THINKS THE PAPER
15043               /IS BEARS NO RELATION TO THE ACTUAL POSITION, WHICH MUST BE AT A PAGE BOUNDARY
15044               /SINCE NO MOTION CAN OCCUR WHEN PRINTING IS INHIBITED.  HENCE, USE ZERO AS THE
15045               /ABSOLUTE VERTICAL POSITION IF PRINTING IS CURRENTLY INHIBITED.
15046               
15047 041324* 1355          TAD     PRSTTB  /GET BACK PRINT INHIBIT FLAG
15048 041325* 7650          SNA CLA         /USE ZERO AS LOCATION IF NOT PRINTING
15049 041326* 1024          TAD     PRGSAP  /GET ABSOLUTE VERTICAL POSITION
15050 041327* 7041          CIA             /NEGATE IT
15051               
15052               /THIS LOOP FINDS THE DISTANCE TO THE NEXT PAGE BOUNDARY.
15053               
15054               PRSTN1,
15055 041330* 1770          TAD     PRQPSZ  /ADD ON THE PAGE SIZE
15056 041331* 7550          SPA SNA         /LEAVE LOOP WHEN IT GOES POSITIVE
15057 041332* 5330          JMP     PRSTN1  /CONTINUE THE LOOP
15058               
15059               /WE NOW MAKE THE MOVE.
15060               
15061 041333* 3354          DCA     PRSTTA  /SAVE THE AMOUNT TO MOVE
15062 041334* 1354          TAD     PRSTTA  /RECOVER THE MOVE
15063 041335* 4767          JMS     PRMOVE  /MAKE THE MOVE
15064 041336* 4766          JMS     PRFMOV  /FORCE THE MOVE
15065               
15066               /THE MOTION ROUTINE UPDATES BOTH THE ABSOLUTE AND RELATIVE VERTICAL POSITIONS.
15067               /HOWEVER, MOTION CAUSED BY STOP ACTION IS NOT ALLOWED TO AFFECT PAGE LAYOUT;
15068               /HENCE, THE RELATIVE VERTICAL POSITION IS READJUSTED TO WHAT IT WAS BEFORE
15069               /THE MOVE.
15070               
15071 041337* 1354          TAD     PRSTTA  /SUBTRACT THE AMOUNT WE MOVED
15072 041340* 7041          CIA
15073 041341* 1023          TAD     PRGSVP  /FROM THE RELATIVE VERTICAL POSITION
15074 041342* 3023          DCA     PRGSVP
15075               
