15753               /***********************************************************************/
15754               /                                                                       /
15755               /       TOP OF PAGE STOP PROCESSING -- TOTALLY REWRITTEN REV 177        /
15756               /                                                                       /
15757               /       HERE WE LOOK AT THE ORIGINAL PRINT MENU SETTING FOR SE          /
15758               /       AND THE CURRENT SETTING, WHICH MAY HAVE CHANGED IF THE          /
15759               /       DOCUMENT CONTAINS "PRINTER SELECT ..." CONTROLS.                /
15760               /       WE MAY HAVE TO STOP, TELL THE USER WHY OR WHAT TO FEED          /
15761               /       DEPENDING ON THE SE MENU SETTING AND WHETHER OR NOT THERE       /
15762               /       IS AN ASF02 ATTACHED.  SEE EACH SECTION FOR MORE COMMENTS       /
15763               /                                                                       /
15764               /       IF AN ASF02 IS ATTACHED WE WILL FED EVERYTHING IN SEQUENCE      /
15765               /       AND NOT DO ANY SPECIAL SKIPPING OR STOPPING. IF NOT WE          /
15766               /       WILL DO AS FOLLOWS:                                             /
15767               /                                                                       /
15768               /       SE NO           PRINT ALL PAGES         DO NOT STOP             /
15769               /       SE FIRST        PRINT ALL PAGES         STOP ON FIRST PAGE      /
15770               /       SE YES          PRINT ALL PAGES         STOP ON ALL PAGES       /
15771               /                                               (USER HAND FEEDS)       /
15772               /       SE LETTERHEAD   PRINT ONLY SHEETS       DO NOT STOP             /
15773               /       SE FRONT        PRINT ONLY SHEETS       DO NOT STOP             /
15774               /       SE REAR         PRINT ONLY SHEETS       DO NOT STOP             /
15775               /       SE ENVELOPE     PRINT ONLY ENVELOPES    STOP FOR EACH ENVELOPE  /
15776               /                                                                       /
15777               /***********************************************************************/
15778               
15779               /       PRQSSM IS ORIGINAL SE SETTING FROM THE PRINT MENU
15780               /       PRQSSS IS THE CURRENT SE SETTING AS MODIFIED BY
15781               /               ANY PRINTER SELECT ... CONTROLS
15782               
15783 041400* 1777  TOPSE,  TAD     PRQSSM          /GET THE SE ORIGINAL MENU SETTING
15784 041401* 1376          TAD     (TOPSET         /ADD IN A TABLE BASE
15785 041402* 3206  TOPSE1, DCA     TOPPTM          /SAVE IN A TEMP
15786 041403* 1606          TAD I   TOPPTM          /GET CONTENTS OF TABLE--ADDRESS TO GOTO
15787 041404* 3206          DCA     TOPPTM          /STUFF IT
15788 041405* 5606          JMP I   TOPPTM          /GO TO IT
15789               
15790 041406* 0000  TOPPTM, 0                       /TEMP FOR THIS ROUTINE
15791               
15792               TOPSET,                 / SE DISPATCH TABLE BASED ON MENU VALUE
15793               
15794               /D180   TOPSL1                  /0--SE NO--ALWAYS SELECT FRONT TRAY
15795               /D180                           /ON SE NO.  MIGHT BE USEFUL IN THE FUTURE
15796               /D180                           /SO CAN MAKE DRAFT COPIES ON CHEAP PAPER
15797               /D180                           /WITH ASF ATTACHED.
15798               
15799 041407* 1526          TOPPL7                  /0--SE NO--SELECT APPROPRIATE TRAY      /A180
15800 041410* 1436          TOPSFI                  /1--SE FIRST
15801 041411* 1443          TOPSEY                  /2--SE YES
15802 041412* 1416          TOPSLE                  /3--SE LETTERHEAD
15803 041413* 1433          TOPSFR                  /4--SE FRONT
15804 041414* 1433          TOPSFR                  /5--SE REAR
15805 041415* 1510          TOPSEN                  /6--SE ENVELOPE
15806                                               /SE NEXT IS PRQSSS=7.  THIS CANNOT OCCUR
15807                                               /ON THE PRINT MENU
15808               
15809               
15810               /WE ARE IN LETTERHEAD MENU MODE (PRQSSM=3).  IF THE MENU SETTING        /C181
15811               /IS STILL SE LETTERHEAD FEED THE FIRST PAGE FROM THE FRONT TRAY         /A181
15812               /AND OTHER PAGES FROM THE REAR.  IF THE SETTING HAS CHANGED             /A181
15813               /SELECT ANY TRAY (EXCEPT ENVELOPE)                                      /A181
15814               
15815               TOPSLE,                         / SE LETTERHEAD IS THE MENU SETTING
15816               
15817               / IF THE FOLLOWING SECTION IS OMITTED THEN ANY PRINTER SELECT CONTROLS  /A181
15818               / WHICH ARE IN THE DOCUMENT WILL BE IGNORED (BUG)                       /A181
